OL,3,AActor Noel Clarke pleads not guilty to
OL,4,Asexual offence charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Noel Clarke has pleaded not
OL,7,Fguilty to sexual offences including
OL,8,Fsexual assault, voyeurism and exposure.
OL,10,FThe former Doctor Who and Kidulthood
OL,11,Fstar appeared at Westminster
OL,12,FMagistrates Court in London on
OL,13,FWednesday on two charges of sexual
OL,14,Fassault, three charges of voyeurism and
OL,15,Fone charge of exposure.
OL,17,FHe pleaded not guilty to all the
OL,18,Fcharges, which relate to alleged
OL,19,Foffences against five women between
OL,20,F2007 and 2016.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
